  ('5f2bc4ae-f0b4-5d20-af94-8018e54f5864', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$How does the first paragraph prepare for the conflict that develops the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It describes the symposium so that the reader knows who will judge the posters.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Her imagined headline shows she already wanted one result, which explains why the data later tempt her to cut dishes.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It proves that Halima did not understand how to set up a controlled experiment.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It shows that Halima chose cloves because her mentor told her they would work.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Her imagined headline shows she already wanted one result, which explains why the data later tempt her to cut dishes.$q$, $q$Halima pictures a "bold headline announcing a natural preservative" before she has data, so her hope sets up the temptation in the second paragraph. Nothing says her mentor suggested cloves.$q$, 'draft', '6e07af05-c302-5308-bdee-146ba797d760')
