   $q$How do the themes of honesty and the usefulness of failure interact in the final paragraph?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The small crowd shows that honesty is admirable but has no practical value to anyone.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-ending"},{"text":"The graduate student's request shows that Halima's results were actually positive after all.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Halima's honest poster draws fewer visitors, yet its complete data guide another researcher, showing honesty is what makes failure useful.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The solar oven poster shows that only positive results attract the attention of scientists.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralizes"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Halima's honest poster draws fewer visitors, yet its complete data guide another researcher, showing honesty is what makes failure useful.$q$, $q$The ending admits a cost (fewer visitors) but shows the honest, complete data helping someone "know where not to look," echoing "a clear no saves someone else a lot of time." The graduate student's request does not change the result to positive.$q$, 'draft', '6e07af05-c302-5308-bdee-146ba797d760')
