  ('a10b889b-557a-516e-82a4-95cd71eabcfe', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Ji-ho's strong but heavy prosthetic hand goes unused, so he redesigns it to match Amara's wishes, she wears it, and he revises the group's design guide.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Ji-ho designs a hand that grips eleven percent more firmly than the standard model.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Ji-ho foolishly wastes a year on a gray hand before a wise child teaches him a lesson.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Ji-ho's first hand breaks during testing, so he prints a purple one for Amara's school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Ji-ho's strong but heavy prosthetic hand goes unused, so he redesigns it to match Amara's wishes, she wears it, and he revises the group's design guide.$q$, $q$The correct choice covers the failed first hand, the redesign, the result, and the new guideline neutrally. The first hand did not break, and "foolishly" and "wise" are opinions.$q$, 'draft', '94c40bda-aadc-5df1-9bef-f79653aa3c85')
