   $q$What does Amara's reason for wanting a sticker panel add to the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows she wants some control over how others see her, so design also affects dignity and choice.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It shows that Amara is embarrassed by her hand and wants to hide it completely.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"},{"text":"It shows that Amara's classmates are unkind and tease her every day.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It shows that Amara values decoration more than being able to use her hand.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-character"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows she wants some control over how others see her, so design also affects dignity and choice.$q$, $q$She would rather classmates "asked about the stickers," which lets her shape the conversation, a need numbers cannot measure. The text never says classmates tease her.$q$, 'draft', '94c40bda-aadc-5df1-9bef-f79653aa3c85')
