        '3-5', $q$How to Play Soccer$q$, $q$(1) Soccer is a sport that people play all over the world. (2) Two teams try to kick a ball into the other team's goal. (3) Each team has eleven players on the field at one time.

(4) Most players may not touch the ball with their hands or arms. (5) They move the ball with their feet, legs, and heads. (6) ___ the goalkeeper is allowed to use hands in the area near the goal. (7) The goalkeeper is the player who guards the goal.

(8) Soccer players need special gear. (9) They wear shin guards to protect the front of their legs. (10) They also wear cleats, which are shoes with bumps on the bottom that grip the grass. (11) Soccer is much more fun than baseball.

(12) That is what I know about soccer.$q$, 'draft')
