insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('07dad6a6-d352-5cff-b17e-f6f990ba4ff3', 'wg3-narrative-writing-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-narrative-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Flat Tire$q$, $q$(1) On Saturday, my bike had a flat tire, and our neighbor Mr. Haddad came over to help me fix it. (2) First, we turned the bike upside down on the driveway. (3) Mr. Haddad pulled the soft rubber tube out of the tire. (4) Then he showed me how to find the tiny hole in the tube. (5) We pumped a little air into the tube and dunked it in a bucket of water. (6) A line of bubbles came out, so we dried that spot, pressed a sticky patch over it, and waited.

(7) I was surprised when the patched tube held air without a single bubble. (8) "Good as new," Mr. Haddad said with a grin. (9) We tucked the tube back inside the tire and pumped it up. (10) The tire felt hard and firm when I squeezed it. (11) My best friend has a pet turtle named Pickles. (12) When we were done, Mr. Haddad let me take the first ride down the street.$q$, 'draft')
