  ('edcd2825-3281-51a9-8980-4c5a4bbd8826', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-opinion-writing'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Why does the writer begin sentence 6 with the words "For example"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To show that sentence 6 disagrees with the idea in sentence 5","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-linking-word"},{"text":"To show that sentence 6 is the concluding statement of the piece","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-as-conclusion"},{"text":"To show that sentence 6 gives an example of the reason in sentence 5","is_correct":true},{"text":"To show that sentence 6 is the main opinion of the whole piece","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-as-opinion"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To show that sentence 6 gives an example of the reason in sentence 5$q$, $q$"For example" tells the reader that Mrs. Ortiz riding to work is an example of how a bike path would help people stay healthy, the reason in sentence 5. It does not show disagreement; a word like "however" would do that.$q$, 'draft', '655162e4-f20c-52cf-af22-3418d5e5221b')
