insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('cd118af1-78db-52c4-968a-cf666c745a60', 'wg3-opinion-writing-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Every Kid Should Learn to Swim$q$, $q$(1) Summer is almost here, and many families will visit pools, lakes and beaches. (2) I believe every third grader should take swimming lessons.

(3) The most important reason is safety. (4) Kids who know how to swim are less likely to get hurt in the water. (5) They also know to float on their backs if they get tired.

(6) Swimming is great exercise too. (7) It makes your arms, legs and lungs stronger. (8) My favorite snack after swimming is a cold orange.

(9) Swimming can help kids make friends. (10) At my lessons, I met two classmates I had never talked to before. (11) Now we practice together every Saturday morning.$q$, 'draft')
